contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0134","start":134,"end":135,"surface":"諶","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0145","start":145,"end":146,"surface":"琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0148","start":148,"end":149,"surface":"諶","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":67,"last_line":67,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　諶字子諒，清敏有理思，好《[[老子|老]]》《[[莊子|莊]]》，善屬文。選尚武帝女滎陽公主，拜駙馬都尉，未成禮而公主卒。後州舉秀才，辟太尉掾。洛陽沒，隨志北依劉琨，與志俱為劉粲所虜。粲據晉陽，留諶為參軍。琨收散卒，引猗盧騎還攻粲。粲敗走，諶得赴琨，先父母兄弟在平陽者，悉為劉聰所害。琨為司空，以諶為主薄，轉從事中郎。琨妻即諶之從母，既加親愛，又重其才地。","raw_start":5453,"raw_end":5633,"raw_line":67},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luchen"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064","text":"及東海王越奉迎大駕，顒啟帝復穎還鄴，以志為魏郡太守，加左將軍，隨穎北鎮。行達洛陽，而平昌公模遣前鋒督護馮嵩距穎。穎還長安，未至而聞顒斬張方，求和於越。穎住華陰，志進長安，詣闕陳謝，即還就穎于武關。奔南陽，復為劉陶所驅，回詣河北。及穎薨，官屬奔散，唯志親自殯送，時人嘉之。越命志為軍諮祭酒，遷衛尉，永嘉末，轉尚書。洛陽沒，志將妻子北投并州刺史劉琨。至陽邑，為劉粲所虜，與次子謐、詵等俱遇害於平陽。長子諶。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0001","start":1,"end":5,"surface":"東海王越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"顒","kind":"person","person_id":"ed0_313_bea","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line0